{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":12,"title":"Path of devotion","hosts":[{"id":"A","name":"Sonia","voice":"en-GB-SoniaNeural"},{"id":"B","name":"Brian","voice":"en-US-BrianMultilingualNeural"}],"duration":603.024,"segments":[{"title":"Welcome","start":0.0},{"title":"The story","start":52.752},{"title":"Lesson 1 · A personal God","start":401.76},{"title":"Lesson 2 · The ladder","start":445.464},{"title":"Lesson 3 · Peace follows letting go","start":493.104},{"title":"Lesson 4 · Dear to God","start":526.032},{"title":"Wrap-up","start":577.488}],"turns":[{"s":"A","start":0.0,"end":3.168,"text":"Welcome to Shruti. I'm Sonia.","L":[],"words":[[0.142,0.526,"Welcome"],[0.682,0.145,"to"],[0.839,0.618,"Shruti"],[1.882,0.211,"I'm"],[2.105,0.658,"Sonia"]]},{"s":"B","start":3.456,"end":8.832,"text":"And I'm Brian. Today, Chapter Twelve: the Path of Devotion.","L":[],"words":[[0.066,0.118,"And"],[0.197,0.184,"I'm"],[0.395,0.513,"Brian"],[1.303,0.539,"Today"],[2.197,0.474,"Chapter"],[2.684,0.605,"Twelve"],[3.658,0.132,"the"],[3.803,0.382,"Path"],[4.197,0.118,"of"],[4.329,0.658,"Devotion"]]},{"s":"A","start":9.12,"end":26.256,"text":"It's one of the shortest chapters, just twenty verses, and many people's favorite. After the overwhelming vision of Chapter Eleven, it's gentle, practical, and full of encouragement. It even has a ladder of steps for people who find the first step too hard.","L":[],"words":[[0.142,0.171,"It's"],[0.326,0.184,"one"],[0.524,0.092,"of"],[0.629,0.092,"the"],[0.734,0.526,"shortest"],[1.274,0.632,"chapters"],[2.195,0.263,"just"],[2.471,0.355,"twenty"],[2.839,0.605,"verses"],[3.668,0.132,"and"],[3.813,0.289,"many"],[4.116,0.434,"people's"],[4.563,0.658,"favorite"],[5.645,0.355,"After"],[6.013,0.158,"the"],[6.184,0.724,"overwhelming"],[6.921,0.342,"vision"],[7.276,0.118,"of"],[7.408,0.421,"Chapter"],[7.842,0.487,"Eleven"],[8.645,0.197,"it's"],[8.855,0.579,"gentle"],[9.671,0.671,"practical"],[10.566,0.118,"and"],[10.697,0.237,"full"],[10.947,0.092,"of"],[11.053,0.921,"encouragement"],[12.395,0.158,"It"],[12.566,0.25,"even"],[12.829,0.211,"has"],[13.053,0.053,"a"],[13.118,0.355,"ladder"],[13.487,0.118,"of"],[13.618,0.539,"steps"],[14.171,0.132,"for"],[14.316,0.342,"people"],[14.671,0.132,"who"],[14.816,0.355,"find"],[15.184,0.092,"the"],[15.289,0.355,"first"],[15.658,0.329,"step"],[16.0,0.237,"too"],[16.25,0.5,"hard"]]},{"s":"B","start":26.544,"end":36.888,"text":"After chapter eleven, I think we all need a bit of gentleness. Arjuna has just seen the whole universe blazing inside his friend, and he's still trembling.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.25,"After"],[0.355,0.461,"chapter"],[0.829,0.632,"eleven"],[1.697,0.145,"I"],[1.855,0.237,"think"],[2.105,0.145,"we"],[2.263,0.211,"all"],[2.487,0.237,"need"],[2.737,0.079,"a"],[2.829,0.158,"bit"],[3.0,0.092,"of"],[3.105,0.75,"gentleness"],[4.276,0.5,"Arjuna"],[4.789,0.197,"has"],[5.0,0.224,"just"],[5.237,0.329,"seen"],[5.579,0.079,"the"],[5.671,0.303,"whole"],[5.987,0.553,"universe"],[6.553,0.513,"blazing"],[7.079,0.421,"inside"],[7.513,0.158,"his"],[7.684,0.474,"friend"],[8.697,0.158,"and"],[8.868,0.158,"he's"],[9.039,0.263,"still"],[9.316,0.632,"trembling"]]},{"s":"A","start":37.176,"end":44.712,"text":"So it makes sense that the next thing he wants to know is simple: how do I actually love You? Which way is best?","L":[],"words":[[0.129,0.211,"So"],[0.353,0.118,"it"],[0.484,0.316,"makes"],[0.813,0.395,"sense"],[1.221,0.171,"that"],[1.405,0.092,"the"],[1.511,0.342,"next"],[1.866,0.224,"thing"],[2.103,0.092,"he"],[2.208,0.276,"wants"],[2.497,0.105,"to"],[2.616,0.276,"know"],[2.905,0.132,"is"],[3.05,0.513,"simple"],[3.945,0.118,"how"],[4.076,0.132,"do"],[4.221,0.132,"I"],[4.366,0.395,"actually"],[4.774,0.25,"love"],[5.037,0.316,"You"],[5.75,0.289,"Which"],[6.053,0.237,"way"],[6.303,0.184,"is"],[6.5,0.658,"best"]]},{"s":"B","start":45.0,"end":51.888,"text":"Four lessons today, and a chapter that feels almost like a letter of encouragement. Story first.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.197,"Four"],[0.303,0.447,"lessons"],[0.763,0.579,"today"],[1.618,0.211,"and"],[1.842,0.066,"a"],[1.921,0.553,"chapter"],[2.487,0.197,"that"],[2.697,0.434,"feels"],[3.145,0.395,"almost"],[3.553,0.158,"like"],[3.724,0.079,"a"],[3.816,0.368,"letter"],[4.197,0.105,"of"],[4.316,0.803,"encouragement"],[5.499,0.421,"Story"],[5.933,0.566,"first"]]},{"s":"A","start":52.752,"end":71.472,"text":"Arjuna has just seen God both as the infinite cosmic form and as his friend Krishna. So he asks, twelve point one: which devotees have the best knowledge of yoga? Those who worship You as Krishna, Your personal aspect, or those who worship the impersonal, the Eternal Being?","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.142,0.579,"Arjuna"],[0.734,0.224,"has"],[0.971,0.263,"just"],[1.247,0.25,"seen"],[1.511,0.355,"God"],[1.879,0.355,"both"],[2.247,0.145,"as"],[2.405,0.118,"the"],[2.537,0.526,"infinite"],[3.076,0.434,"cosmic"],[3.524,0.461,"form"],[3.997,0.197,"and"],[4.208,0.158,"as"],[4.379,0.171,"his"],[4.563,0.342,"friend"],[4.918,0.579,"Krishna"],[5.908,0.224,"So"],[6.145,0.211,"he"],[6.368,0.513,"asks"],[7.105,0.329,"twelve"],[7.447,0.329,"point"],[7.789,0.329,"one"],[8.487,0.263,"which"],[8.763,0.658,"devotees"],[9.434,0.184,"have"],[9.632,0.105,"the"],[9.75,0.303,"best"],[10.066,0.316,"knowledge"],[10.395,0.105,"of"],[10.513,0.539,"yoga"],[11.461,0.329,"Those"],[11.803,0.118,"who"],[11.934,0.487,"worship"],[12.434,0.171,"You"],[12.618,0.132,"as"],[12.763,0.553,"Krishna"],[13.566,0.132,"Your"],[13.711,0.539,"personal"],[14.263,0.592,"aspect"],[15.158,0.079,"or"],[15.25,0.276,"those"],[15.539,0.105,"who"],[15.658,0.5,"worship"],[16.171,0.092,"the"],[16.276,0.737,"impersonal"],[17.263,0.092,"the"],[17.368,0.487,"Eternal"],[17.868,0.461,"Being"]]},{"s":"B","start":71.76,"end":82.2,"text":"Twelve point two: I consider the best yogis to be those ever-steadfast devotees who worship with supreme faith by fixing their mind on Me as their personal God.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.092,0.355,"Twelve"],[0.461,0.289,"point"],[0.763,0.421,"two"],[1.882,0.158,"I"],[2.053,0.434,"consider"],[2.5,0.105,"the"],[2.618,0.316,"best"],[2.947,0.461,"yogis"],[3.421,0.105,"to"],[3.539,0.158,"be"],[3.711,0.289,"those"],[4.013,0.855,"ever-steadfast"],[4.882,0.539,"devotees"],[5.434,0.184,"who"],[5.632,0.447,"worship"],[6.092,0.132,"with"],[6.237,0.487,"supreme"],[6.737,0.447,"faith"],[7.197,0.171,"by"],[7.382,0.434,"fixing"],[7.829,0.145,"their"],[7.987,0.355,"mind"],[8.355,0.158,"on"],[8.526,0.329,"Me"],[8.868,0.171,"as"],[9.053,0.158,"their"],[9.224,0.421,"personal"],[9.658,0.395,"God"]]},{"s":"B","start":82.488,"end":96.048,"text":"Notice the words: ever-steadfast, supreme faith, mind fixed on Me. It's not about a single dramatic moment of devotion. It's about where the mind keeps coming home to.","L":[],"words":[[0.066,0.434,"Notice"],[0.513,0.118,"the"],[0.645,0.526,"words"],[1.961,0.974,"ever-steadfast"],[3.395,0.539,"supreme"],[3.947,0.5,"faith"],[4.947,0.408,"mind"],[5.368,0.382,"fixed"],[5.763,0.145,"on"],[5.921,0.276,"Me"],[6.576,0.158,"It's"],[6.747,0.276,"not"],[7.037,0.382,"about"],[7.432,0.066,"a"],[7.511,0.539,"single"],[8.063,0.618,"dramatic"],[8.695,0.461,"moment"],[9.168,0.158,"of"],[9.339,0.684,"devotion"],[10.405,0.158,"It's"],[10.576,0.355,"about"],[10.945,0.276,"where"],[11.234,0.092,"the"],[11.339,0.487,"mind"],[11.839,0.329,"keeps"],[12.182,0.276,"coming"],[12.471,0.342,"home"],[12.826,0.329,"to"]]},{"s":"A","start":96.336,"end":113.496,"text":"But he doesn't exclude the other path. Twelve point three and four: they also attain Me who worship the unchangeable, the invisible, the omnipresent, the inconceivable Eternal Being, with senses restrained, even-minded, and engaged in the welfare of all creatures.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.101,0.211,"But"],[0.324,0.118,"he"],[0.456,0.382,"doesn't"],[0.851,0.592,"exclude"],[1.456,0.145,"the"],[1.614,0.224,"other"],[1.851,0.566,"path"],[2.801,0.408,"Twelve"],[3.222,0.276,"point"],[3.511,0.237,"three"],[3.761,0.118,"and"],[3.893,0.382,"four"],[4.59,0.132,"they"],[4.735,0.342,"also"],[5.09,0.382,"attain"],[5.485,0.158,"Me"],[5.656,0.171,"who"],[5.84,0.474,"worship"],[6.327,0.105,"the"],[6.445,0.776,"unchangeable"],[7.445,0.092,"the"],[7.551,0.671,"invisible"],[8.432,0.118,"the"],[8.564,0.816,"omnipresent"],[9.63,0.105,"the"],[9.748,0.882,"inconceivable"],[10.643,0.447,"Eternal"],[11.103,0.368,"Being"],[11.774,0.158,"with"],[11.945,0.474,"senses"],[12.432,0.645,"restrained"],[13.314,0.75,"even-minded"],[14.301,0.132,"and"],[14.445,0.566,"engaged"],[15.024,0.079,"in"],[15.116,0.066,"the"],[15.195,0.513,"welfare"],[15.722,0.184,"of"],[15.919,0.158,"all"],[16.09,0.684,"creatures"]]},{"s":"B","start":113.784,"end":127.248,"text":"The difference is difficulty. Twelve point five: Self-realization is more difficult for those who fix their mind on the impersonal, because comprehension of the unmanifest is attained by human beings with difficulty.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.079,0.105,"The"],[0.197,0.579,"difference"],[0.789,0.211,"is"],[1.013,0.829,"difficulty"],[2.263,0.329,"Twelve"],[2.605,0.276,"point"],[2.895,0.539,"five"],[4.079,0.987,"Self-realization"],[5.079,0.132,"is"],[5.224,0.224,"more"],[5.461,0.526,"difficult"],[6.0,0.158,"for"],[6.171,0.276,"those"],[6.461,0.132,"who"],[6.605,0.316,"fix"],[6.934,0.158,"their"],[7.105,0.408,"mind"],[7.526,0.118,"on"],[7.658,0.039,"the"],[7.711,0.724,"impersonal"],[8.776,0.276,"because"],[9.066,0.658,"comprehension"],[9.737,0.092,"of"],[9.842,0.079,"the"],[9.934,0.75,"unmanifest"],[10.697,0.132,"is"],[10.842,0.487,"attained"],[11.342,0.132,"by"],[11.487,0.355,"human"],[11.855,0.355,"beings"],[12.224,0.158,"with"],[12.395,0.671,"difficulty"]]},{"s":"A","start":127.536,"end":132.336,"text":"It's hard to love an abstraction. It's natural to love a person.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.142,0.171,"It's"],[0.326,0.329,"hard"],[0.668,0.118,"to"],[0.8,0.263,"love"],[1.076,0.092,"an"],[1.182,0.921,"abstraction"],[2.526,0.197,"It's"],[2.737,0.553,"natural"],[3.303,0.132,"to"],[3.447,0.237,"love"],[3.697,0.079,"a"],[3.789,0.632,"person"]]},{"s":"B","start":132.624,"end":143.208,"text":"And that's not a criticism of the other path. The Gita is just being honest about human beings. Most of us find it easier to love a face than an idea.","L":[],"words":[[0.053,0.132,"And"],[0.197,0.316,"that's"],[0.526,0.316,"not"],[0.868,0.092,"a"],[0.974,0.776,"criticism"],[1.776,0.171,"of"],[1.961,0.105,"the"],[2.079,0.237,"other"],[2.329,0.566,"path"],[3.303,0.079,"The"],[3.395,0.395,"Gita"],[3.803,0.211,"is"],[4.026,0.263,"just"],[4.303,0.263,"being"],[4.579,0.487,"honest"],[5.079,0.303,"about"],[5.395,0.342,"human"],[5.75,0.553,"beings"],[6.724,0.368,"Most"],[7.105,0.105,"of"],[7.224,0.197,"us"],[7.434,0.303,"find"],[7.75,0.118,"it"],[7.882,0.474,"easier"],[8.368,0.145,"to"],[8.526,0.276,"love"],[8.816,0.079,"a"],[8.908,0.434,"face"],[9.355,0.158,"than"],[9.526,0.105,"an"],[9.645,0.553,"idea"]]},{"s":"A","start":143.496,"end":152.256,"text":"It's like the difference between admiring kindness in general, and having a friend who is kind to you. The second one changes your life.","L":[],"words":[[0.142,0.171,"It's"],[0.326,0.25,"like"],[0.589,0.118,"the"],[0.721,0.539,"difference"],[1.274,0.382,"between"],[1.668,0.579,"admiring"],[2.261,0.579,"kindness"],[2.853,0.132,"in"],[2.997,0.487,"general"],[3.813,0.066,"and"],[3.892,0.316,"having"],[4.221,0.053,"a"],[4.287,0.408,"friend"],[4.708,0.132,"who"],[4.853,0.118,"is"],[4.984,0.342,"kind"],[5.339,0.105,"to"],[5.458,0.316,"you"],[6.197,0.118,"The"],[6.329,0.5,"second"],[6.842,0.263,"one"],[7.118,0.5,"changes"],[7.632,0.118,"your"],[7.763,0.605,"life"]]},{"s":"B","start":152.544,"end":161.784,"text":"And for those who love the personal God, twelve point six and seven: I swiftly become their savior from the ocean of death and rebirth.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.105,0.145,"And"],[0.263,0.158,"for"],[0.434,0.289,"those"],[0.737,0.158,"who"],[0.908,0.382,"love"],[1.303,0.105,"the"],[1.421,0.434,"personal"],[1.868,0.474,"God"],[2.776,0.395,"twelve"],[3.184,0.276,"point"],[3.474,0.395,"six"],[3.882,0.105,"and"],[4.0,0.513,"seven"],[5.145,0.158,"I"],[5.316,0.513,"swiftly"],[5.842,0.355,"become"],[6.211,0.145,"their"],[6.368,0.487,"savior"],[6.868,0.171,"from"],[7.053,0.066,"the"],[7.132,0.395,"ocean"],[7.539,0.145,"of"],[7.697,0.368,"death"],[8.092,0.158,"and"],[8.263,0.579,"rebirth"]]},{"s":"A","start":162.072,"end":175.248,"text":"And look at what they do in those verses: they offer all their actions to Me, they're intent on Me, they meditate on Me. So devotion here isn't only feeling. It's a whole life pointed in one direction.","L":[],"words":[[0.142,0.118,"And"],[0.274,0.184,"look"],[0.471,0.092,"at"],[0.576,0.158,"what"],[0.747,0.145,"they"],[0.905,0.224,"do"],[1.142,0.105,"in"],[1.261,0.237,"those"],[1.511,0.592,"verses"],[2.418,0.132,"they"],[2.563,0.382,"offer"],[2.958,0.224,"all"],[3.195,0.118,"their"],[3.326,0.553,"actions"],[3.892,0.118,"to"],[4.024,0.237,"Me"],[4.55,0.145,"they're"],[4.708,0.447,"intent"],[5.168,0.145,"on"],[5.326,0.211,"Me"],[5.787,0.118,"they"],[5.918,0.566,"meditate"],[6.497,0.145,"on"],[6.655,0.25,"Me"],[7.316,0.237,"So"],[7.566,0.632,"devotion"],[8.211,0.368,"here"],[8.592,0.329,"isn't"],[8.934,0.276,"only"],[9.224,0.605,"feeling"],[10.224,0.197,"It's"],[10.434,0.053,"a"],[10.5,0.289,"whole"],[10.803,0.329,"life"],[11.145,0.474,"pointed"],[11.632,0.132,"in"],[11.776,0.224,"one"],[12.013,0.776,"direction"]]},{"s":"A","start":175.536,"end":183.96,"text":"Then the ladder. Twelve point eight: focus your mind on Me, let your intellect dwell on Me, and you shall certainly attain Me.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.142,0.289,"Then"],[0.445,0.118,"the"],[0.576,0.579,"ladder"],[1.553,0.355,"Twelve"],[1.921,0.329,"point"],[2.263,0.342,"eight"],[2.934,0.395,"focus"],[3.342,0.118,"your"],[3.474,0.342,"mind"],[3.829,0.145,"on"],[3.987,0.224,"Me"],[4.5,0.197,"let"],[4.711,0.158,"your"],[4.882,0.553,"intellect"],[5.447,0.25,"dwell"],[5.711,0.145,"on"],[5.868,0.224,"Me"],[6.368,0.132,"and"],[6.513,0.105,"you"],[6.632,0.224,"shall"],[6.868,0.526,"certainly"],[7.408,0.368,"attain"],[7.789,0.25,"Me"]]},{"s":"B","start":184.248,"end":194.496,"text":"Twelve point nine: if you are unable to focus your mind steadily on Me, then long to attain Me by practice of any other spiritual discipline that suits you.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.092,0.329,"Twelve"],[0.434,0.276,"point"],[0.724,0.316,"nine"],[1.763,0.118,"if"],[1.895,0.118,"you"],[2.026,0.171,"are"],[2.211,0.382,"unable"],[2.605,0.079,"to"],[2.697,0.434,"focus"],[3.145,0.105,"your"],[3.263,0.316,"mind"],[3.592,0.513,"steadily"],[4.118,0.158,"on"],[4.289,0.197,"Me"],[5.158,0.184,"then"],[5.355,0.276,"long"],[5.645,0.132,"to"],[5.789,0.382,"attain"],[6.184,0.158,"Me"],[6.355,0.132,"by"],[6.5,0.592,"practice"],[7.105,0.158,"of"],[7.368,0.25,"any"],[7.632,0.25,"other"],[7.895,0.553,"spiritual"],[8.461,0.553,"discipline"],[9.118,0.145,"that"],[9.276,0.329,"suits"],[9.618,0.25,"you"]]},{"s":"A","start":194.784,"end":207.456,"text":"Twelve point ten: if you are unable even to do any spiritual discipline, then be intent on performing all your duty for Me. You shall attain perfection just by working for Me as an instrument.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.101,0.408,"Twelve"],[0.522,0.355,"point"],[0.891,0.395,"ten"],[1.628,0.118,"if"],[1.759,0.132,"you"],[1.904,0.118,"are"],[2.036,0.592,"unable"],[2.641,0.276,"even"],[2.93,0.118,"to"],[3.062,0.224,"do"],[3.299,0.224,"any"],[3.536,0.553,"spiritual"],[4.101,0.605,"discipline"],[5.049,0.184,"then"],[5.246,0.118,"be"],[5.378,0.447,"intent"],[5.838,0.105,"on"],[5.957,0.671,"performing"],[6.641,0.171,"all"],[6.825,0.132,"your"],[6.97,0.368,"duty"],[7.351,0.184,"for"],[7.549,0.263,"Me"],[8.211,0.171,"You"],[8.395,0.25,"shall"],[8.658,0.368,"attain"],[9.039,0.724,"perfection"],[9.776,0.303,"just"],[10.092,0.158,"by"],[10.263,0.474,"working"],[10.75,0.145,"for"],[10.908,0.276,"Me"],[11.197,0.171,"as"],[11.382,0.092,"an"],[11.487,0.789,"instrument"]]},{"s":"B","start":207.744,"end":221.832,"text":"And twelve point eleven: if you are unable even to work for Me, then just surrender to My will, and renounce attachment to and anxiety for the fruits of all work, learning to accept all results as God's grace.","L":["L2","L3"],"words":[[0.092,0.118,"And"],[0.224,0.382,"twelve"],[0.618,0.25,"point"],[0.882,0.5,"eleven"],[1.987,0.184,"if"],[2.184,0.145,"you"],[2.342,0.171,"are"],[2.526,0.461,"unable"],[3.0,0.25,"even"],[3.263,0.118,"to"],[3.395,0.276,"work"],[3.684,0.145,"for"],[3.842,0.303,"Me"],[4.658,0.237,"then"],[4.908,0.224,"just"],[5.145,0.461,"surrender"],[5.618,0.092,"to"],[5.724,0.197,"My"],[5.934,0.408,"will"],[6.724,0.197,"and"],[6.934,0.434,"renounce"],[7.382,0.605,"attachment"],[8.0,0.289,"to"],[8.303,0.092,"and"],[8.408,0.632,"anxiety"],[9.053,0.118,"for"],[9.184,0.092,"the"],[9.289,0.342,"fruits"],[9.645,0.105,"of"],[9.763,0.237,"all"],[10.013,0.421,"work"],[10.908,0.395,"learning"],[11.316,0.118,"to"],[11.447,0.421,"accept"],[11.895,0.25,"all"],[12.158,0.474,"results"],[12.645,0.184,"as"],[12.842,0.329,"God's"],[13.184,0.526,"grace"]]},{"s":"A","start":222.12,"end":227.256,"text":"Every rung leads to the same place. There's always a step you can take.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.116,0.289,"Every"],[0.418,0.342,"rung"],[0.774,0.395,"leads"],[1.182,0.118,"to"],[1.313,0.105,"the"],[1.432,0.303,"same"],[1.747,0.618,"place"],[2.789,0.237,"There's"],[3.039,0.382,"always"],[3.434,0.079,"a"],[3.526,0.342,"step"],[3.882,0.105,"you"],[4.0,0.184,"can"],[4.197,0.539,"take"]]},{"s":"B","start":227.544,"end":240.432,"text":"What I love about this ladder is that it's built for real people. Krishna doesn't say, if you can't meditate, give up. He says, fine, do something else. And if that's too hard, something simpler again.","L":[],"words":[[0.079,0.132,"What"],[0.224,0.105,"I"],[0.342,0.289,"love"],[0.645,0.303,"about"],[0.961,0.184,"this"],[1.158,0.461,"ladder"],[1.632,0.197,"is"],[1.842,0.211,"that"],[2.066,0.184,"it's"],[2.263,0.303,"built"],[2.579,0.237,"for"],[2.829,0.25,"real"],[3.092,0.526,"people"],[4.013,0.395,"Krishna"],[4.421,0.342,"doesn't"],[4.776,0.355,"say"],[5.158,0.145,"if"],[5.316,0.105,"you"],[5.434,0.316,"can't"],[5.763,0.618,"meditate"],[6.395,0.263,"give"],[6.671,0.342,"up"],[7.408,0.066,"He"],[7.487,0.263,"says"],[7.763,0.421,"fine"],[8.197,0.145,"do"],[8.355,0.382,"something"],[8.75,0.421,"else"],[9.551,0.132,"And"],[9.696,0.132,"if"],[9.841,0.263,"that's"],[10.117,0.184,"too"],[10.314,0.513,"hard"],[11.064,0.434,"something"],[11.512,0.487,"simpler"],[12.012,0.474,"again"]]},{"s":"A","start":240.72,"end":250.896,"text":"Even the lowest rung, just let go of the results and accept what comes as grace, is a complete path. It's not second class. It gets you there.","L":[],"words":[[0.116,0.316,"Even"],[0.445,0.092,"the"],[0.55,0.421,"lowest"],[0.984,0.368,"rung"],[1.642,0.25,"just"],[1.905,0.197,"let"],[2.116,0.184,"go"],[2.313,0.105,"of"],[2.432,0.092,"the"],[2.537,0.566,"results"],[3.116,0.132,"and"],[3.261,0.447,"accept"],[3.721,0.171,"what"],[3.905,0.289,"comes"],[4.208,0.118,"as"],[4.339,0.487,"grace"],[5.089,0.105,"is"],[5.208,0.066,"a"],[5.287,0.5,"complete"],[5.8,0.526,"path"],[6.724,0.224,"It's"],[6.961,0.263,"not"],[7.237,0.434,"second"],[7.684,0.605,"class"],[8.684,0.158,"It"],[8.855,0.329,"gets"],[9.197,0.158,"you"],[9.368,0.408,"there"]]},{"s":"B","start":251.184,"end":266.256,"text":"Then a ranking, twelve point twelve: the knowledge of scriptures is better than mere ritual; meditation is better than scriptural knowledge; renunciation of attachment to the fruits of work is better than meditation; and peace immediately follows renunciation.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.092,0.184,"Then"],[0.289,0.066,"a"],[0.368,0.566,"ranking"],[0.961,0.355,"twelve"],[1.329,0.263,"point"],[1.605,0.553,"twelve"],[2.434,0.118,"the"],[2.566,0.382,"knowledge"],[2.961,0.066,"of"],[3.039,0.566,"scriptures"],[3.618,0.158,"is"],[3.789,0.303,"better"],[4.105,0.158,"than"],[4.276,0.25,"mere"],[4.539,0.513,"ritual"],[5.513,0.605,"meditation"],[6.132,0.132,"is"],[6.276,0.316,"better"],[6.605,0.132,"than"],[6.75,0.474,"scriptural"],[7.237,0.592,"knowledge"],[8.158,0.737,"renunciation"],[8.908,0.066,"of"],[8.987,0.579,"attachment"],[9.579,0.092,"to"],[9.684,0.092,"the"],[9.789,0.303,"fruits"],[10.105,0.105,"of"],[10.224,0.289,"work"],[10.526,0.158,"is"],[10.697,0.289,"better"],[11.0,0.145,"than"],[11.158,0.75,"meditation"],[12.224,0.224,"and"],[12.461,0.316,"peace"],[12.789,0.539,"immediately"],[13.342,0.461,"follows"],[13.816,0.868,"renunciation"]]},{"s":"A","start":266.544,"end":270.408,"text":"Immediately. That's the word that stands out.","L":[],"words":[[0.116,0.947,"Immediately"],[1.487,0.316,"That's"],[1.816,0.118,"the"],[1.947,0.408,"word"],[2.368,0.197,"that"],[2.579,0.434,"stands"],[3.026,0.461,"out"]]},{"s":"B","start":270.696,"end":279.168,"text":"Not eventually, not in the next life. Immediately. The moment you stop gripping the outcome, there's room to breathe.","L":[],"words":[[0.066,0.276,"Not"],[0.355,0.697,"eventually"],[1.079,0.395,"not"],[1.5,0.145,"in"],[1.658,0.079,"the"],[1.75,0.342,"next"],[2.105,0.461,"life"],[2.945,0.895,"Immediately"],[4.25,0.066,"The"],[4.329,0.355,"moment"],[4.697,0.092,"you"],[4.803,0.434,"stop"],[5.25,0.368,"gripping"],[5.632,0.092,"the"],[5.737,0.539,"outcome"],[6.855,0.237,"there's"],[7.105,0.316,"room"],[7.434,0.105,"to"],[7.553,0.526,"breathe"]]},{"s":"B","start":279.456,"end":301.176,"text":"And then the rest of the chapter is a portrait: who is dear to God. Twelve point thirteen and fourteen: one who does not hate any creature, who is friendly and compassionate, free from the notion of I and my, even-minded in pain and pleasure, forgiving, ever content, firm in resolve, and devoted to Me, is dear to Me.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.092,0.145,"And"],[0.25,0.263,"then"],[0.526,0.079,"the"],[0.618,0.368,"rest"],[1.0,0.079,"of"],[1.092,0.079,"the"],[1.184,0.566,"chapter"],[1.763,0.158,"is"],[1.934,0.079,"a"],[2.026,0.671,"portrait"],[