","start":313.488,"end":324.744,"text":"I find that one convicting. Not agitated by others is hard enough. Not agitating others, that asks me to notice the effect I have on every room I walk into.","L":[],"words":[[0.053,0.079,"I"],[0.145,0.355,"find"],[0.513,0.237,"that"],[0.763,0.276,"one"],[1.053,0.75,"convicting"],[2.224,0.316,"Not"],[2.553,0.684,"agitated"],[3.25,0.25,"by"],[3.513,0.447,"others"],[3.974,0.158,"is"],[4.145,0.316,"hard"],[4.474,0.526,"enough"],[5.421,0.329,"Not"],[5.763,0.658,"agitating"],[6.434,0.461,"others"],[6.921,0.263,"that"],[7.197,0.368,"asks"],[7.579,0.145,"me"],[7.737,0.118,"to"],[7.868,0.487,"notice"],[8.368,0.066,"the"],[8.447,0.434,"effect"],[8.895,0.105,"I"],[9.013,0.263,"have"],[9.289,0.132,"on"],[9.434,0.289,"every"],[9.737,0.276,"room"],[10.026,0.092,"I"],[10.132,0.289,"walk"],[10.434,0.434,"into"]]},{"s":"B","start":325.032,"end":335.28,"text":"Twelve point seventeen: one who neither rejoices nor grieves, neither likes nor dislikes, and is full of devotion, is dear to Me.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.092,0.368,"Twelve"],[0.474,0.316,"point"],[0.803,0.816,"seventeen"],[2.303,0.316,"one"],[2.632,0.171,"who"],[2.816,0.342,"neither"],[3.171,0.658,"rejoices"],[3.842,0.197,"nor"],[4.053,0.592,"grieves"],[5.066,0.355,"neither"],[5.434,0.395,"likes"],[5.842,0.171,"nor"],[6.026,0.737,"dislikes"],[7.132,0.171,"and"],[7.316,0.145,"is"],[7.474,0.25,"full"],[7.737,0.105,"of"],[7.855,0.671,"devotion"],[8.855,0.224,"is"],[9.092,0.289,"dear"],[9.395,0.118,"to"],[9.526,0.316,"Me"]]},{"s":"A","start":335.568,"end":352.392,"text":"And twelve point sixteen, in between: one who is desireless, pure, wise, impartial, free from anxiety, who has renounced the sense of being the doer. Such a devotee is dear to Me. The word dear just keeps repeating, like a refrain.","L":[],"words":[[0.142,0.132,"And"],[0.287,0.342,"twelve"],[0.642,0.276,"point"],[0.932,0.632,"sixteen"],[1.787,0.118,"in"],[1.918,0.539,"between"],[2.8,0.224,"one"],[3.037,0.158,"who"],[3.208,0.118,"is"],[3.339,0.816,"desireless"],[4.379,0.355,"pure"],[5.011,0.5,"wise"],[5.721,0.737,"impartial"],[6.708,0.237,"free"],[6.958,0.171,"from"],[7.142,0.737,"anxiety"],[8.234,0.079,"who"],[8.326,0.145,"has"],[8.484,0.461,"renounced"],[8.958,0.092,"the"],[9.063,0.329,"sense"],[9.405,0.118,"of"],[9.537,0.25,"being"],[9.8,0.105,"the"],[9.918,0.355,"doer"],[10.671,0.316,"Such"],[11.0,0.079,"a"],[11.092,0.658,"devotee"],[11.763,0.211,"is"],[11.987,0.276,"dear"],[12.276,0.132,"to"],[12.421,0.303,"Me"],[13.145,0.092,"The"],[13.25,0.368,"word"],[13.632,0.316,"dear"],[13.961,0.263,"just"],[14.237,0.303,"keeps"],[14.553,0.632,"repeating"],[15.461,0.184,"like"],[15.658,0.066,"a"],[15.737,0.684,"refrain"]]},{"s":"A","start":352.68,"end":372.0,"text":"Twelve point eighteen and nineteen: the same toward friend or foe, in honor or disgrace, heat or cold, pleasure or pain. Indifferent to censure or praise, quiet, content with whatever one has, unattached to a place, a country or a house. That person is dear to Me.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.101,0.368,"Twelve"],[0.482,0.289,"point"],[0.785,0.408,"eighteen"],[1.206,0.105,"and"],[1.324,0.645,"nineteen"],[2.311,0.092,"the"],[2.416,0.289,"same"],[2.719,0.342,"toward"],[3.074,0.342,"friend"],[3.43,0.092,"or"],[3.535,0.434,"foe"],[4.206,0.158,"in"],[4.377,0.395,"honor"],[4.864,0.105,"or"],[4.982,0.75,"disgrace"],[6.009,0.224,"heat"],[6.245,0.092,"or"],[6.351,0.487,"cold"],[7.061,0.474,"pleasure"],[7.548,0.145,"or"],[7.706,0.5,"pain"],[8.632,0.618,"Indifferent"],[9.263,0.092,"to"],[9.368,0.526,"censure"],[9.908,0.145,"or"],[10.066,0.592,"praise"],[10.908,0.566,"quiet"],[11.737,0.447,"content"],[12.197,0.132,"with"],[12.342,0.395,"whatever"],[12.75,0.197,"one"],[12.961,0.368,"has"],[13.632,0.579,"unattached"],[14.224,0.092,"to"],[14.329,0.066,"a"],[14.408,0.5,"place"],[15.118,0.053,"a"],[15.184,0.579,"country"],[15.868,0.158,"or"],[16.039,0.039,"a"],[16.092,0.592,"house"],[17.092,0.289,"That"],[17.395,0.566,"person"],[17.974,0.211,"is"],[18.197,0.276,"dear"],[18.487,0.132,"to"],[18.632,0.289,"Me"]]},{"s":"B","start":372.288,"end":386.16,"text":"And the last verse, which is the kindest in the chapter. Twelve point twenty: but those faithful devotees are very dear to Me who set Me as their supreme goal and follow, or just sincerely try to develop, these values.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.079,0.118,"And"],[0.211,0.105,"the"],[0.329,0.395,"last"],[0.737,0.487,"verse"],[1.25,0.263,"which"],[1.526,0.158,"is"],[1.697,0.105,"the"],[1.816,0.513,"kindest"],[2.342,0.118,"in"],[2.474,0.079,"the"],[2.566,0.645,"chapter"],[3.632,0.329,"Twelve"],[3.974,0.237,"point"],[4.224,0.539,"twenty"],[5.25,0.211,"but"],[5.474,0.25,"those"],[5.737,0.395,"faithful"],[6.145,0.526,"devotees"],[6.684,0.118,"are"],[6.816,0.303,"very"],[7.132,0.25,"dear"],[7.395,0.118,"to"],[7.526,0.289,"Me"],[7.829,0.158,"who"],[8.0,0.276,"set"],[8.289,0.224,"Me"],[8.526,0.118,"as"],[8.658,0.158,"their"],[8.829,0.474,"supreme"],[9.316,0.316,"goal"],[9.645,0.092,"and"],[9.75,0.513,"follow"],[10.592,0.197,"or"],[10.803,0.237,"just"],[11.053,0.553,"sincerely"],[11.618,0.289,"try"],[11.921,0.118,"to"],[12.053,0.553,"develop"],[12.618,0.224,"these"],[12.855,0.618,"values"]]},{"s":"A","start":386.448,"end":392.712,"text":"Just sincerely try. Nobody has all of those qualities. Trying counts.","L":[],"words":[[0.101,0.342,"Just"],[0.456,0.632,"sincerely"],[1.101,0.526,"try"],[2.039,0.553,"Nobody"],[2.605,0.263,"has"],[2.882,0.224,"all"],[3.118,0.105,"of"],[3.237,0.25,"those"],[3.5,0.842,"qualities"],[4.737,0.434,"Trying"],[5.184,0.684,"counts"]]},{"s":"B","start":393.0,"end":400.896,"text":"That's the verse I'd put on the fridge. The whole list of virtues ends, not with a test, but with an invitation.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.276,"That's"],[0.382,0.105,"the"],[0.5,0.408,"verse"],[0.921,0.289,"I'd"],[1.224,0.237,"put"],[1.474,0.158,"on"],[1.645,0.079,"the"],[1.737,0.579,"fridge"],[2.724,0.066,"The"],[2.803,0.355,"whole"],[3.171,0.342,"list"],[3.526,0.092,"of"],[3.632,0.539,"virtues"],[4.184,0.461,"ends"],[4.658,0.355,"not"],[5.026,0.145,"with"],[5.184,0.053,"a"],[5.25,0.579,"test"],[6.158,0.25,"but"],[6.421,0.171,"with"],[6.605,0.079,"an"],[6.697,0.803,"invitation"]]},{"s":"B","start":401.76,"end":407.472,"text":"Lesson one: personal devotion to God is superior to impersonal worship.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.066,0.421,"Lesson"],[0.5,0.447,"one"],[1.526,0.434,"personal"],[1.974,0.526,"devotion"],[2.513,0.118,"to"],[2.645,0.421,"God"],[3.092,0.171,"is"],[3.276,0.632,"superior"],[3.921,0.197,"to"],[4.132,0.618,"impersonal"],[4.763,0.553,"worship"]]},{"s":"A","start":407.76,"end":416.616,"text":"Loving God as a person, with form and relationship, is easier and more direct for most people than meditating on the formless Absolute.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.142,0.382,"Loving"],[0.537,0.263,"God"],[0.813,0.105,"as"],[0.932,0.079,"a"],[1.024,0.579,"person"],[1.8,0.171,"with"],[1.984,0.461,"form"],[2.55,0.092,"and"],[2.655,0.829,"relationship"],[3.787,0.132,"is"],[3.932,0.447,"easier"],[4.392,0.132,"and"],[4.537,0.197,"more"],[4.747,0.5,"direct"],[5.261,0.118,"for"],[5.392,0.316,"most"],[5.721,0.368,"people"],[6.103,0.145,"than"],[6.261,0.697,"meditating"],[6.971,0.105,"on"],[7.089,0.092,"the"],[7.195,0.5,"formless"],[7.708,0.763,"Absolute"]]},{"s":"B","start":416.904,"end":424.512,"text":"Both reach the same goal. But to those devoted to His personal form, God personally becomes the rescuer.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.092,0.303,"Both"],[0.408,0.316,"reach"],[0.737,0.092,"the"],[0.842,0.316,"same"],[1.171,0.434,"goal"],[2.013,0.132,"But"],[2.158,0.118,"to"],[2.289,0.329,"those"],[2.632,0.526,"devoted"],[3.171,0.118,"to"],[3.303,0.197,"His"],[3.513,0.434,"personal"],[3.961,0.526,"form"],[4.974,0.434,"God"],[5.421,0.539,"personally"],[5.974,0.434,"becomes"],[6.421,0.092,"the"],[6.526,0.684,"rescuer"]]},{"s":"B","start":424.8,"end":436.656,"text":"A note from us, not from the book. In the wider tradition, this is why so many people keep an image, a name or a story of God close by. It gives the heart something to hold.","L":[],"words":[[0.051,0.092,"A"],[0.156,0.329,"note"],[0.498,0.25,"from"],[0.761,0.276,"us"],[1.051,0.368,"not"],[1.432,0.224,"from"],[1.669,0.092,"the"],[1.774,0.461,"book"],[2.658,0.079,"In"],[2.75,0.079,"the"],[2.842,0.342,"wider"],[3.197,0.645,"tradition"],[3.868,0.211,"this"],[4.092,0.118,"is"],[4.224,0.237,"why"],[4.474,0.211,"so"],[4.697,0.197,"many"],[4.908,0.355,"people"],[5.276,0.237,"keep"],[5.526,0.079,"an"],[5.618,0.592,"image"],[6.632,0.105,"a"],[6.75,0.461,"name"],[7.224,0.184,"or"],[7.421,0.053,"a"],[7.487,0.434,"story"],[7.934,0.105,"of"],[8.053,0.645,"God close"],[8.711,0.395,"by"],[9.486,0.092,"It"],[9.591,0.289,"gives"],[9.894,0.105,"the"],[10.012,0.368,"heart"],[10.394,0.408,"something"],[10.815,0.079,"to"],[10.907,0.553,"hold"]]},{"s":"A","start":436.944,"end":444.6,"text":"And yet the Gita never mocks the seeker of the formless. Both are welcome. One road is just steeper.","L":[],"words":[[0.116,0.158,"And"],[0.287,0.263,"yet"],[0.563,0.118,"the"],[0.695,0.447,"Gita"],[1.155,0.329,"never"],[1.497,0.408,"mocks"],[1.918,0.118,"the"],[2.05,0.474,"seeker"],[2.537,0.145,"of"],[2.695,0.092,"the"],[2.8,0.776,"formless"],[4.0,0.303,"Both"],[4.316,0.092,"are"],[4.421,0.671,"welcome"],[5.513,0.658,"One road"],[6.184,0.184,"is"],[6.382,0.276,"just"],[6.671,0.605,"steeper"]]},{"s":"A","start":445.464,"end":449.976,"text":"Lesson two: four ascending levels of spiritual practice.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.142,0.434,"Lesson"],[0.589,0.408,"two"],[1.339,0.25,"four"],[1.603,0.5,"ascending"],[2.116,0.461,"levels"],[2.589,0.145,"of"],[2.747,0.605,"spiritual"],[3.366,0.75,"practice"]]},{"s":"B","start":450.264,"end":463.824,"text":"If you can't fix your mind on God, practice any discipline. If you can't do that, work for God without selfish motive. If you can't do that, surrender the results and accept everything as grace.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.05,0.132,"If"],[0.195,0.092,"you"],[0.3,0.329,"can't"],[0.642,0.289,"fix"],[0.945,0.105,"your"],[1.063,0.382,"mind"],[1.458,0.171,"on"],[1.642,0.513,"God"],[2.589,0.579,"practice"],[3.195,0.25,"any"],[3.458,0.658,"discipline"],[4.497,0.145,"If"],[4.655,0.092,"you"],[4.761,0.342,"can't"],[5.116,0.184,"do"],[5.313,0.329,"that"],[5.668,0.316,"work"],[5.997,0.145,"for"],[6.155,0.382,"God"],[6.55,0.368,"without"],[6.932,0.461,"selfish"],[7.405,0.526,"motive"],[8.313,0.132,"If"],[8.458,0.092,"you"],[8.563,0.342,"can't"],[8.918,0.184,"do"],[9.116,0.382,"that"],[10.011,0.579,"surrender"],[10.603,0.092,"the"],[10.708,0.605,"results"],[11.339,0.158,"and"],[11.511,0.461,"accept"],[11.997,0.487,"everything"],[12.497,0.118,"as"],[12.629,0.539,"grace"]]},{"s":"A","start":464.112,"end":471.336,"text":"Each level leads to the same destination. There's a starting point for everyone, wherever they are today.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.116,0.289,"Each"],[0.418,0.382,"level"],[0.813,0.408,"leads"],[1.234,0.118,"to"],[1.366,0.132,"the"],[1.511,0.329,"same"],[1.853,0.921,"destination"],[3.197,0.211,"There's"],[3.421,0.079,"a"],[3.513,0.526,"starting"],[4.053,0.342,"point"],[4.408,0.132,"for"],[4.553,0.632,"everyone"],[5.474,0.447,"wherever"],[5.934,0.158,"they"],[6.105,0.092,"are"],[6.211,0.618,"today"]]},{"s":"A","start":471.624,"end":488.256,"text":"In practice, it might look like this. On a calm morning, you sit and remember God. On a busy day, you do your work as an offering. And on a hard day, when you can't do either, you simply say, whatever happens, I'll take it as Your grace.","L":[],"words":[[0.116,0.171,"In"],[0.3,0.724,"practice"],[1.261,0.118,"it"],[1.392,0.263,"might"],[1.668,0.184,"look"],[1.866,0.263,"like"],[2.142,0.461,"this"],[3.026,0.145,"On"],[3.184,0.066,"a"],[3.263,0.329,"calm"],[3.605,0.5,"morning"],[4.421,0.105,"you"],[4.539,0.368,"sit"],[4.921,0.092,"and"],[5.026,0.447,"remember"],[5.487,0.461,"God"],[6.368,0.145,"On"],[6.526,0.066,"a"],[6.605,0.303,"busy"],[6.921,0.382,"day"],[7.632,0.118,"you"],[7.763,0.118,"do"],[7.895,0.145,"your"],[8.053,0.395,"work"],[8.461,0.092,"as"],[8.566,0.118,"an"],[8.697,0.579,"offering"],[9.697,0.158,"And"],[9.868,0.132,"on"],[10.013,0.039,"a"],[10.066,0.342,"hard"],[10.421,0.355,"day"],[10.987,0.132,"when"],[11.132,0.092,"you"],[11.237,0.342,"can't"],[11.592,0.184,"do"],[11.789,0.434,"either"],[12.513,0.079,"you"],[12.605,0.408,"simply"],[13.026,0.382,"say"],[13.605,0.368,"whatever"],[13.987,0.592,"happens"],[14.829,0.132,"I'll"],[14.974,0.263,"take"],[15.25,0.132,"it"],[15.395,0.105,"as"],[15.513,0.132,"Your"],[15.658,0.592,"grace"]]},{"s":"B","start":488.544,"end":492.24,"text":"Three different days, three different rungs, the same ladder.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.303,"Three"],[0.408,0.329,"different"],[0.75,0.421,"days"],[1.197,0.316,"three"],[1.526,0.342,"different"],[1.882,0.434,"rungs"],[2.342,0.105,"the"],[2.461,0.342,"same"],[2.816,0.5,"ladder"]]},{"s":"B","start":493.104,"end":498.384,"text":"Lesson three: renouncing attachment to results brings immediate peace.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.092,0.355,"Lesson"],[0.461,0.513,"three"],[1.5,0.645,"renouncing"],[2.158,0.645,"attachment"],[2.816,0.118,"to"],[2.947,0.539,"results"],[3.5,0.368,"brings"],[3.882,0.513,"immediate"],[4.408,0.474,"peace"]]},{"s":"A","start":498.672,"end":509.016,"text":"Ritual, then scripture, then meditation, then letting go of attachment to outcomes. That last one is the highest, and the peace comes at once.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.116,0.645,"Ritual"],[0.984,0.197,"then"],[1.195,0.645,"scripture"],[2.089,0.184,"then"],[2.287,0.803,"meditation"],[3.405,0.171,"then"],[3.589,0.329,"letting"],[3.932,0.158,"go"],[4.103,0.105,"of"],[4.221,0.671,"attachment"],[4.905,0.118,"to"],[5.037,0.763,"outcomes"],[6.211,0.303,"That"],[6.526,0.382,"last"],[6.921,0.25,"one"],[7.184,0.118,"is"],[7.316,0.079,"the"],[7.408,0.632,"highest"],[8.316,0.092,"and"],[8.421,0.105,"the"],[8.539,0.355,"peace"],[8.908,0.303,"comes"],[9.224,0.118,"at"],[9.355,0.592,"once"]]},{"s":"B","start":509.304,"end":515.928,"text":"It's the most direct bridge between action and freedom. You can cross it in the middle of a busy day.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.05,0.184,"It's"],[0.247,0.079,"the"],[0.339,0.355,"most"],[0.708,0.461,"direct"],[1.182,0.447,"bridge"],[1.642,0.434,"between"],[2.103,0.5,"action"],[2.616,0.132,"and"],[2.761,0.553,"freedom"],[3.711,0.092,"You"],[3.816,0.158,"can"],[3.987,0.421,"cross"],[4.421,0.184,"it"],[4.632,0.171,"in"],[4.816,0.079,"the"],[4.908,0.382,"middle"],[5.303,0.092,"of"],[5.408,0.092,"a"],[5.513,0.316,"busy"],[5.842,0.395,"day"]]},{"s":"B","start":516.216,"end":525.168,"text":"I like that the highest practice on the list isn't a special technique. It's an attitude you can bring to washing the dishes or sending an email.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.079,"I"],[0.184,0.263,"like"],[0.461,0.276,"that"],[0.75,0.092,"the"],[0.855,0.5,"highest"],[1.368,0.513,"practice"],[1.895,0.158,"on"],[2.066,0.105,"the"],[2.184,0.421,"list"],[2.632,0.289,"isn't"],[2.934,0.039,"a"],[2.987,0.421,"special"],[3.421,0.684,"technique"],[4.484,0.171,"It's"],[4.668,0.092,"an"],[4.774,0.539,"attitude"],[5.326,0.118,"you"],[5.458,0.184,"can"],[5.655,0.303,"bring"],[5.971,0.158,"to"],[6.142,0.5,"washing"],[6.655,0.105,"the"],[6.774,0.539,"dishes"],[7.326,0.184,"or"],[7.524,0.395,"sending"],[7.932,0.092,"an"],[8.037,0.526,"email"]]},{"s":"A","start":526.032,"end":530.04,"text":"And lesson four: the qualities of a true devotee.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.142,0.158,"And"],[0.313,0.408,"lesson"],[0.734,0.408,"four"],[1.458,0.092,"the"],[1.563,0.697,"qualities"],[2.274,0.158,"of"],[2.445,0.066,"a"],[2.524,0.342,"true"],[2.879,0.737,"devotee"]]},{"s":"B","start":530.328,"end":549.768,"text":"No hatred toward any creature. Friendly and compassionate. Free of ego and possessiveness. Even-minded, forgiving, content, steady, devoted, pure, free from anxiety, the same toward praise and blame, friend and foe.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.079,0.224,"No"],[0.316,0.526,"hatred"],[0.855,0.382,"toward"],[1.25,0.224,"any"],[1.487,0.618,"creature"],[2.526,0.592,"Friendly"],[3.132,0.197,"and"],[3.342,0.895,"compassionate"],[4.658,0.461,"Free"],[5.132,0.197,"of"],[5.355,0.5,"ego"],[5.868,0.158,"and"],[6.039,0.934,"possessiveness"],[7.395,0.697,"Even-minded"],[8.566,0.553,"forgiving"],[9.592,0.592,"content"],[10.697,0.526,"steady"],[11.763,0.539,"devoted"],[12.829,0.447,"pure"],[13.895,0.329,"free"],[14.237,0.171,"from"],[14.421,0.632,"anxiety"],[15.684,0.092,"the"],[15.789,0.395,"same"],[16.197,0.329,"toward"],[16.539,0.408,"praise"],[16.961,0.092,"and"],[17.066,0.461,"blame"],[18.0,0.434,"friend"],[18.447,0.145,"and"],[18.605,0.447,"foe"]]},{"s":"A","start":550.056,"end":559.392,"text":"Not agitating others, and not agitated by them. These are the marks of someone dear to God, and God says it's enough to sincerely try.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.116,0.316,"Not"],[0.445,0.671,"agitating"],[1.129,0.474,"others"],[1.839,0.132,"and"],[1.984,0.263,"not"],[2.261,0.658,"agitated"],[2.932,0.197,"by"],[3.142,0.316,"them"],[3.882,0.289,"These"],[4.184,0.079,"are"],[4.276,0.105,"the"],[4.395,0.421,"marks"],[4.829,0.092,"of"],[4.934,0.395,"someone"],[5.342,0.237,"dear"],[5.592,0.118,"to"],[5.724,0.395,"God"],[6.434,0.118,"and"],[6.566,0.276,"God"],[6.855,0.276,"says"],[7.145,0.171,"it's"],[7.329,0.368,"enough"],[7.711,0.105,"to"],[7.829,0.605,"sincerely"],[8.447,0.5,"try"]]},{"s":"A","start":559.68,"end":568.992,"text":"Read that list slowly once a week. Not to feel guilty, but to see which one you'd like to grow next. That's sincerely trying.","L":[],"words":[[0.129,0.368,"Read"],[0.511,0.237,"that"],[0.761,0.368,"list"],[1.142,0.421,"slowly"],[1.576,0.329,"once"],[1.918,0.053,"a"],[1.984,0.487,"week"],[2.882,0.263,"Not"],[3.158,0.105,"to"],[3.276,0.263,"feel"],[3.553,0.553,"guilty"],[4.408,0.184,"but"],[4.605,0.092,"to"],[4.711,0.289,"see"],[5.013,0.25,"which"],[5.276,0.237,"one"],[5.526,0.171,"you'd"],[5.711,0.25,"like"],[5.974,0.105,"to"],[6.092,0.224,"grow"],[6.329,0.605,"next"],[7.355,0.303,"That's"],[7.671,0.618,"sincerely"],[8.303,0.618,"trying"]]},{"s":"B","start":569.28,"end":576.624,"text":"And it's a lovely place for the chapter to end: not with what God demands, but with who God holds dear.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.118,"And"],[0.224,0.132,"it's"],[0.368,0.066,"a"],[0.447,0.395,"lovely"],[0.855,0.395,"place"],[1.263,0.105,"for"],[1.382,0.079,"the"],[1.474,0.461,"chapter"],[1.947,0.118,"to"],[2.079,0.447,"end"],[3.197,0.395,"not"],[3.605,0.171,"with"],[3.789,0.211,"what"],[4.013,0.25,"God"],[4.276,0.632,"demands"],[5.276,0.211,"but"],[5.5,0.145,"with"],[5.658,0.158,"who"],[5.829,0.289,"God"],[6.132,0.382,"holds"],[6.526,0.434,"dear"]]},{"s":"B","start":577.488,"end":588.312,"text":"So, Chapter Twelve. Love God as a person, take whatever step on the ladder you can, let go of results, and grow the qualities that make you dear to God.","L":["L1","L2","L3","L4"],"words":[[0.051,0.224,"So"],[0.288,0.474,"Chapter"],[0.775,0.566,"Twelve"],[1.763,0.303,"Love"],[2.079,0.316,"God"],[2.408,0.105,"as"],[2.526,0.079,"a"],[2.618,0.592,"person"],[3.684,0.263,"take"],[3.961,0.342,"whatever"],[4.316,0.329,"step"],[4.658,0.092,"on"],[4.763,0.079,"the"],[4.855,0.355,"ladder"],[5.224,0.158,"you"],[5.395,0.368,"can"],[6.197,0.276,"let"],[6.487,0.237,"go"],[6.737,0.105,"of"],[6.855,0.645,"results"],[7.829,0.224,"and"],[8.066,0.289,"grow"],[8.368,0.079,"the"],[8.461,0.605,"qualities"],[9.079,0.158,"that"],[9.25,0.211,"make"],[9.474,0.105,"you"],[9.592,0.263,"dear"],[9.868,0.092,"to"],[9.974,0.447,"God"]]},{"s":"A","start":588.6,"end":595.2,"text":"Four lessons: a personal God, the ladder, peace follows letting go, and dear to God.","L":["L1","L2","L3","L4"],"words":[[0.129,0.184,"Four"],[0.326,0.711,"lessons"],[1.339,0.053,"a"],[1.405,0.566,"personal"],[1.984,0.382,"God"],[2.616,0.105,"the"],[2.734,0.487,"ladder"],[3.484,0.303,"peace"],[3.8,0.395,"follows"],[4.208,0.329,"letting"],[4.55,0.368,"go"],[5.155,0.158,"and"],[5.326,0.289,"dear"],[5.629,0.118,"to"],[5.761,0.447,"God"]]},{"s":"B","start":595.488,"end":603.024,"text":"Next time, Chapter Thirteen: the body, the Spirit, and how to tell them apart. Thanks for listening to Shruti.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.289,"Next"],[0.395,0.395,"time"],[0.803,0.421,"Chapter"],[1.237,0.75,"Thirteen"],[2.355,0.158,"the"],[2.526,0.461,"body"],[3.013,0.092,"the"],[3.118,0.539,"Spirit"],[3.684,0.118,"and"],[3.816,0.158,"how"],[3.987,0.105,"to"],[4.105,0.211,"tell"],[4.329,0.145,"them"],[4.487,0.526,"apart"],[5.434,0.342,"Thanks"],[5.789,0.171,"for"],[5.974,0.447,"listening"],[6.434,0.118,"to"],[6.566,0.579,"Shruti"]]}]}